==English==

===Etymology===
From {{m|en|literate}} + {{m|en|-cy}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|UK}} {{IPA|en|/ˈlɪt.ɹə.si/}}
* {{a|US}} {{IPA|en|/ˈlɪt.əɹ.ə.si/}}
* {{audio|en|en-us-literacy.ogg|Audio (US)}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# The [[ability]] to [[read]] and [[write]].
# The ability to [[understand]] and [[evaluate]] something.
#: ''computer literacy; media literacy''

